Brau-1589","photo":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/actor/271004/photo/6544da8f4cd33.jpg"},{"name":"Hiroki Yasumoto","character":"Montblanc","photo":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/actor/301118/photo/64f5f2f5b6a76.jpg"},{"name":"Kouichi Yamadera","character":"North #2","photo":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/actor/7916957/photo/64f5f2f6ba597.jpg"},{"name":"Toshihiko Seki","character":"Pluto","photo":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/actor/282388/photo/64f5f2fa8c3b4.jpg"}],"writers":[{"name":"手塚治虫","character":"手塚治虫","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/4xOgZySBani7h7xkFwK4Rf0MqNg.jpg","tmdbId":58160},{"name":"浦沢直樹","character":"浦沢直樹","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/xpXOtyO3gvJZbnRfwhXDBeeVwEP.jpg","tmdbId":115936}],"certification":"TV-14","seasonPosters":["https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/season/2047492/posters/66b886f4445b3.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt26737616:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"1. Episodio 1","overview":"Un querido robot suizo aparece despedazado. Entretanto, el inspector Gesicht (un robot de la Europol) investiga otro asesinato con elementos inquietantemente similares.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9617842/screencap/653a12a833347.jpg","released":"2023-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"71 min"},{"id":"tt26737616:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"2. Episodio 2","overview":"Encuentran otro cadáver con cuernos. Gesicht se pone en contacto con Atom, el más avanzado de los siete robots, para que le ayude a analizar los asesinatos en serie.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9876567/screencap/653a12aab8bfa.jpg","released":"2023-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt26737616:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"3. Episodio 3","overview":"El profesor Abra se reúne con el inspector Tawashi con motivo del asesinato de Tazaki. Gesicht empieza a sospechar que sus datos podrían estar en peligro.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9876568/screencap/653a12ac8e2c7.jpg","released":"2023-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"63 min"},{"id":"tt26737616:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"4. Episodio 4","overview":"El profesor Ochanomizu se lleva a casa un perro robot abandonado para intentar repararlo. Poco después, recibe la visita de una figura misteriosa que dice ser su dueño.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9876569/screencap/653a12add897a.jpg","released":"2023-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt26737616:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"5. Episodio 5","overview":"Gesicht investiga el pasado de Adolf Haas tras llevarlo a un refugio. Entretanto, Heracles y Épsilon perciben una misteriosa amenaza que avanza hacia ellos.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9876570/screencap/653a12b0218c2.jpg","released":"2023-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt26737616:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"6. Episodio 6","overview":"Gesicht se ve con Abra en el Reino de Persia para continuar con la investigación y detecta una mentira. Luego, un niño robot le ayuda a acercarse un poco más a la verdad.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9876572/screencap/653a12b1e88ad.jpg","released":"2023-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt26737616:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"7. Episodio 7","overview":"El Dr. Tenma intenta devolverle la vida a Atom, cueste lo que cueste. Un agente de seguridad lleva a Épsilon, que es ahora el próximo objetivo del asesino, a un refugio.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9876573/screencap/653a12b40ff62.jpg","released":"2023-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"56 min"},{"id":"tt26737616:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"8. Episodio 8","overview":"El profesor Ochanomizu observa de cerca el comportamiento errático de Atom. El Dr. Tenma se enfrenta a su pasado y la verdad sale a la luz, desatando una amenaza brutal.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9876574/screencap/653a12b650c58.jpg","released":"2023-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"68 min"}]}}